EntityDescription,A floating restorative totem summoned by Juggernaut that heals nearby allies for a percentage of their maximum HP each turn.,主宰召唤的悬浮治疗图腾，每回合为周围友方单位按最大生命值百分比回复生命。
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",由活水潮汐凝聚而成的智慧元素，能随心重塑自身的力量与敏捷形态。
EntityName,healing ward,治疗守卫
EntityName,waterkin,变体水灵
ExplosionName,berserkers call wave,狂战士之吼冲击波
ExplosionName,blade fury spin,剑刃风暴旋斩
ExplosionName,counter helix spin,反击螺旋血刃旋斩
ExplosionName,waveform splash,波浪形态水爆
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,由活水潮汐凝聚的远程水弹，可作为弹弓无限弹药发射。
ItemName,tidal orb,潮汐水弹
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 4 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 4 turns after taking damage.,先天技能「剑心犹在」：每连续 4 回合未受伤害叠加 1 层（上限 10 层），每层提供 +1% 移速与 +2.5% 等效敏捷攻速及近战/无敌斩额外伤害；受伤后保留 4 回合粘滞期。
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,先天技能「潮涨潮落」：敏捷提供额外移速与远程攻击距离；力量提供额外施法距离与减速抗性（变形期间持续保留）。
PropertyDescription,"Innate (One Man Army): While no living allies are within 4 tiles (lingers 6 turns when an ally approaches), Axe gains bonus Strength equal to 50% of his excess Defence (Defence - 10), increasing melee attack damage.",先天技能「一人之军」：只要斧王周围 4 格内没有存活友军（友军靠近后保留 6 回合粘滞期），就会获得相当于自身超额防御（Defence - 10）50% 的等效力量加成，提升近战攻击伤害。
PropertyDescription,Leaping between nearby enemies in a blur of invulnerable strikes: immune to all damage and debuffs while slashing a nearby foe each turn.,无敌斩连斩中：全程免疫一切伤害与负面状态，每回合自动瞬移斩击附近一名敌方单位。
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% chance (by Blade Dance skill level 1-4) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.",被动技能「剑舞」：近战普攻、无敌斩与剑刃风暴有 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% 概率（随剑舞技能等级 1~4 级独立提升）触发 1.8 倍致命一击。
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Counter Helix): Every 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 incoming attacks (by Counter Helix skill level 1-4, including missed attacks) triggers a 3x3 crimson axe spin dealing 100 / 120 / 140 / 160 Pure damage (1d6+3 to 3d6).",被动技能「反击螺旋」：每受到 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 次敌方攻击（随反击螺旋技能等级 1~4 级提升，7.42 包含被闪避或高防 Miss 的攻击），触发 3×3 血刃旋斩，造成 100 / 120 / 140 / 160 纯粹伤害（1d6+3~3d6）。
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.",剑刃风暴旋转中：免疫负面状态、获得 80% 魔法/元素伤害减免，并每回合对周围敌人造成魔法伤害。
PropertyName,blade dance,剑舞
PropertyName,blade fury,剑刃风暴
PropertyName,bladeform,剑心犹在
PropertyName,counter helix,反击螺旋
