RaceName,waterkin//male,变体水灵
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,变体水灵
SpellDescription,Afflict a targeted enemy within 4 to 7 tiles for 24 turns with Pure damage over time (12/16/20/24 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15) and 16%/19%/22%/25% movement slow; dispelled if the target kills any unit.,对 4~7 格内一名敌方施加持续 24 回合的战斗饥渴：持续造成纯粹伤害（12/16/20/24 DPS 按 K_dmg=15 折算）并降低 16%/19%/22%/25% 移速；目标击杀任意单位时立即驱散。
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",指向一名生物并化身为对方形态，复制其外形、属性、技能与法术，且先天技能「潮涨潮落」持续保留。
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin for 10 to 12 turns: debuff immunity, 80% magical DR, and 1d4 to 2d4+2 base magical damage per turn (85-205 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15, scaled by DEX & Bladeform attack speed) to adjacent 3x3 foes; can crit with Blade Dance.",基础驱散自身负面状态并舞起持续 10~12 回合的剑刃风暴：获得减益免疫与 80% 魔法减伤，每回合对周围 3×3 敌人造成 1d4~2d4+2 基础魔法伤害（85~205 DPS 按 K_dmg=15 折算，并受敏捷与剑心犹在攻速频率缩放，可触发剑舞）。
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",化作汹涌波浪向前闪烁突进，对周围敌人造成水波范围伤害，并短暂获得穿墙与幻影闪避。
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.",发射高压水波造成基础水伤并击退眩晕目标：额外爆发伤害随敏捷/力量比值动态提升，眩晕时长随力量/敏捷比值动态延长。
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes (weapon + stat + 2 to 3 bonus damage per slash) across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance crits and Bladeform bonuses.",跃向目标敌人并在周围敌方单位间连续发动 5~12 次无敌武器斩击（单斩伤害 = 武器骰 + 属性修正 + 2~3 额外攻击力），全程免疫一切伤害，每次斩击均可触发剑舞与剑心犹在加成。
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,解除当前变形状态，立即切回变体水灵本体。
SpellDescription,"Roar to taunt enemies within 2 tiles (3 with Lv 25 talent) for 4 to 6 turns, silencing their spells and forcing them to march and attack Axe while granting +6 to +8 Defence (+10 with Lv 15 talent).",发出震天怒吼，嘲讽周围 2 格（Lv 25 天赋 3 格）内所有敌方持续 4~6 回合，禁止其施法并强制其靠近并近战攻击斧王，同时自身获得 +6~+8 防御（Lv 15 天赋封顶 +10）。
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",将敏捷转化为力量与体质（随变化系熟练度每次 1~5 点），总量守恒并同步提升最大生命与当前生命。
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",将力量与体质转化为敏捷（随变化系熟练度每次 1~5 点），总量守恒并降低最大生命值，当前生命值仅在超过新上限时截断。
SpellDescription,"Strike a nearby foe (range 2) with Pure force: instantly executes targets at or below 18/25/32 HP (+mastery/talent), refunding 100% mana, granting nearby allies +25% move speed and +7/+8/+8 Defence for 12 turns, and stacking permanent armor; otherwise deals 5d6+1 to 9d6 Pure damage.",以纯粹之力劈向 2 格内敌方：目标生命 ≤ 18/25/32 HP（随熟练度与天赋提高）时无视减伤瞬间处决、100% 返还法力、给予周围友军 12 回合 +25% 移速与 +7/+8/+8 防御战吼并叠加永久护甲；否则造成 5d6+1~9d6 纯粹伤害。
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 36 to 48 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 1% to 3.25% of their maximum HP each turn.",召唤一个 1 点生命值的可移动治疗守卫（同时上限 1 个，持续 36~48 回合），每回合为周围 2 格友方回复 1%~3.25% 最大生命值。
